entries[118674] = { ["name"] = "Vital Mists", ["text"] = "Instant\nYou become adept in the ways of the Mistweaver, amplifying four of your abilities.\n\nCrackling Jade Lightning\nDamage increased by 100%.\n\nTiger Palm\nDamage increased by 100%. When you Tiger Palm, you gain Vital Mists, reducing the cast time and mana cost of your next Surging Mist by 20%. Stacks up to 5 times. Lasts 30 sec.\n\nBlackout Kick\nBlackout Kick also hits 4 additional nearby targets for 50% damage.\nWhen you Blackout Kick, you gain Serpent's Zeal causing you [ Summon Jade Serpent Statue : and your summoned Jade Serpent Statue ]to heal nearby injured targets equal to 25% of your auto-attack damage.\n\nSpinning Crane Kick\nWhile channeling Spinning Crane Kick, you also heal nearby injured allies for [ 2809 + (Spell Power * 0.1152)] every 0.75 sec for 2.25 sec. Healing yourself does not count for Chi generation." }
